- `churn queue add --issue <i> --task ... [--front] [--model m] [--backend agy] [--pr <n>] [--after-pr <n> ...]
   [--allow-workflows] [--agy-step <s>] [--needs-owner]`;  `churn queue park --index <k> --note ...`;  `churn queue rm --index <k>`
- `churn agy result --issue <i> --step <s> --verdict PASS|FIXED|REJECT [--pr <n>] [--denials k] [--notes ...]`
   after every agy checker review (two REJECTs at a step route that step's agy items back to Claude by themselves)
The daily scorecard is written by the gate itself; don't write a daily summary.
